{"title": "Knowledge of the Ages: Wisdom", "pageid": 30084, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Knowledge_of_the_Ages:_Wisdom", "categories": ["Class actions", "Actions", "Channel Divinity actions"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp/300px-Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp, /w/images/1/1b/Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/1b/Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp/300px-Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/1b/Knowledge_of_the_Ages.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Knowledge of the Ages</b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_Divinity_Charge\" title=\"Channel Divinity Charge\">Channel Divinity</a> action available to <a href=\"/wiki/Knowledge_Domain\" title=\"Knowledge Domain\">Knowledge Domain</a> clerics. It allows these clerics to channel divine power, gaining <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">proficiency</a> in all <a href=\"/wiki/Skills\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skills\">skills</a> of a chosen ability score.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nGain <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency\" title=\"Proficiency\">Proficiency</a> in all <a href=\"/wiki/Skills\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a> based on <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a>.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-ic