dge_of_the_Ages\" title=\"Knowledge of the Ages\">Knowledge of the Ages</a></span>\n</p>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This action does not stack with other versions of Knowledge of the Ages. Only one type can be active at once and recasting the ability will remove the old effect.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715062218\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.067 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.071 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2377/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 39371/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 15064/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1117818/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n110.59%   65.055     28 Template:Trim\n100.00%   58.827      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   58.827      1 -total\n 21.12%   12.426      1 Template:Condition\n 19.95%   11.734      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 12.83%    7.547      1 Template:Resource\n 11.59%    6.819      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 11.04%    6.496      3 Template:Main_namespace_only\n 10.33%    6.075      3 Template:Icon_text\n  8.40%    4.941      1 Template:PageSeo\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:30084-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715062218 and revision id 323013. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}